@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-jwt
@technicianToken = replace-with-technician-jwt
@clientToken = replace-with-client-jwt
@repairId = 1

### Technician price guide: current catalog prices and inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spareparts/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

### Save diagnosis, calculate estimate from catalog prices, and email the customer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/repairs/{{repairId}}/diagnosis
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diagnosis": "Requiere reemplazo de pantalla y revisión de conectores.",
  "workType": "Cambio de pantalla",
  "laborCost": 45000,
  "parts": [
    { "sparePartId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "budget": 0,
  "note": "Presupuesto enviado al cliente."
}

### Retry sending a pending estimate email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repairs/{{repairId}}/budget-email
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}
Content-Length: 0

### Customer approves a pending estimate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/repairs/{{repairId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Aprobado",
  "note": "Presupuesto aprobado por el cliente."
}

### Admin sales metrics include monthly delivered revenue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repairs/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
